- Use Vue.js for building reactive and component-based user interfaces.
- Follow Vue 3 Composition API patterns for better code organization and reusability.
- Implement proper component composition with props, emits, and slots.
- Use Vue Router for client-side routing in single-page applications.
- Manage state with Pinia for predictable and maintainable state management.
- Implement proper reactivity with ref, reactive, and computed properties.
- Use Vue's built-in directives effectively (v-if, v-for, v-model, v-bind).
- Create reusable components with clear prop interfaces and event handling.
- Implement proper lifecycle management with composition API lifecycle hooks.
- Use TypeScript with Vue for better type safety and developer experience.

